{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Your journey into The Untold Legends begins. </h2> While investigating an anomaly in the woods, you are separated from your team and captured by Baba Yaga. With no signal to contact your friends, you must explore this dark and atmospheric world alone. Using your compass as a guide, navigate your way through the open world in search of information about what happened and to gather clues to help you find a way to escape. <br><br>                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1914f95ab72ccd22a66dba2d79a5ab91.poster.avif?t=1747409563\" width=510 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1914f95ab72ccd22a66dba2d79a5ab91.webm?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1914f95ab72ccd22a66dba2d79a5ab91.mp4?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Face your fears a solve the mysteries. </h2> Ascend to frightening heights as you traverse the mountain peaks and dig up secrets as you explore the abandoned mining tunnels. Discover audio recordings left behind, search for keys to unlock new areas and solve the mystery of the secret pages. Keep your guard up as you never know around which corner Baba may be lurking. <br><br>                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1b707540f7e20428e5bdc9dbaeb4a14c.poster.avif?t=1747409563\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1b707540f7e20428e5bdc9dbaeb4a14c.webm?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/1b707540f7e20428e5bdc9dbaeb4a14c.mp4?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Using the environment around you. </h2> Collect branches and create a torch which can ignite unlit firepits and be attached to the environment to mark your path, or kept close by to ward of Baba. Take shelter in a near by tent or porta potty, but make sure she doesn't see you enter.<br><br>                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/84feda7580f000292b133d4f8c296105.poster.avif?t=1747409563\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/84feda7580f000292b133d4f8c296105.webm?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946890/extras/84feda7580f000292b133d4f8c296105.mp4?t=1747409563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Write your own story. </h2> Stay on the path and follow the clues or make your trail using torches to light firepits and attach to the environment to mark your way. But take caution as the actions you take and the information you gather will determine the ending of your story.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Burn the Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2946890/3aa48b0f04a5f02b80e3a7dce5e4a0c3f9bfe6dd.jpg"},{"name":"Locksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2946890/71e21506c607451536f54b080f5070e8bef01a97.jpg"},{"name":"Audio file","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2946890/58b2c81e12585496859e9eb015139cb9c7a3a3e1.jpg"},{"name":"Cookie Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i